{
  "Cornell Notes Template": {
    "prefix": "cornell",
    "body": [
      "# Cornell Notes",
      "",
      "## Topic: $1",
      "",
      "## Date: $2",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "### Cue Column (Questions, Keywords, or Prompts)",
      "",
      "- ${3:[Insert question or keyword]}",
      "- [Insert question or keyword]",
      "- [Insert question or keyword]",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "### Notes Section (Main Notes)",
      "",
      "- ${4:[Insert main notes or details]}",
      "- [Include important points, diagrams, or examples]",
      "- [Use bullet points, numbers, or paragraphs as needed]",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "### Summary Section (Summary of Notes)",
      "",
      "${0:[Insert a brief summary of the key ideas and takeaways]}"
    ],
    "description": "Cornell note-taking system template"
  },

  "AUTOSAR Requirements Template": {
    "prefix": "autosar-req",
    "description": "AUTOSAR-style requirements document template",
    "body": [
      "# Requirements on ${1:System/Component Name}",
      "",
      "| Attribute        | Value                          |",
      "|------------------|-------------------------------|",
      "| **Document ID**  | ${2:AUTOSAR_RS_XXX}            |",
      "| **Document Status** | ${3:Draft}                  |",
      "| **Version**      | ${4:0.1.0}                     |",
      "| **Date**         | ${5:YYYY-MM-DD}                |",
      "| **Author**       | ${6:Author Name}               |",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## Document Change History",
      "",
      "| Version | Date       | Author          | Change Description |",
      "|---------|------------|-----------------|-------------------|",
      "| 0.1.0   | ${5:YYYY-MM-DD} | ${6:Author Name} | Initial draft    |",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## Table of Contents",
      "",
      "- [1. Scope](#1-scope)",
      "- [2. References](#2-references)",
      "- [3. Constraints and Assumptions](#3-constraints-and-assumptions)",
      "- [4. Requirements](#4-requirements)",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## 1. Scope",
      "",
      "${7:Describe the scope of this requirements document.}",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## 2. References",
      "",
      "| #   | Document Title       | Version |",
      "|-----|----------------------|---------|",
      "| [1] | ${8:Reference Title} | ${9:1.0.0} |",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## 3. Constraints and Assumptions",
      "",
      "${10:Describe constraints and assumptions.}",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## 4. Requirements",
      "",
      "### 4.1 ${11:Requirement Category}",
      "",
      "#### [${12:RS_XXX_00001}] ${13:Short Requirement Title}",
      "",
      "| Attribute    | Value                              |",
      "|--------------|------------------------------------|",
      "| **Type**     | ${14:Functional}                   |",
      "| **Status**   | ${15:Draft}                        |",
      "| **Priority** | ${16:High}                         |",
      "",
      "**Description:**  ",
      "${17:Detailed description of the requirement.}",
      "",
      "**Rationale:**  ",
      "${18:Why this requirement exists.}",
      "",
      "**Use Case:**  ",
      "${19:Use case this requirement supports.}",
      "",
      "**Dependencies:**  ",
      "- ${20:RS_XXX_YYYYY}",
      "",
      "---",
      "",
      "## 5. References",
      "${0}",
    ]
  }
}
